# sleep.txt: SP$ TapAll (creatures target player controls), then DB$ PumpAll |
# Defined$ Targeted | ValidCards$ Creature | KW$ HIDDEN This card doesn't
# untap during your next untap step. | Duration$ Permanent.
# PumpAllEffect.applyPumpAll (PumpAllEffect.java:34-70) gives the hidden line
# to every creature ai controls and none of human's: both of ai's creatures
# stay tapped through ai's untap step, its Forest untaps.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 U
tapformana human 3 U
tapformana human 4 U
tapformana human 5 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue targets ai
castspell human 1
resolvestack
# Main1 -> ... -> Cleanup -> ai's Untap.
advance 10
